The staging folder for agent fragments, kept in git although it is empty.

git does not track directories, only files, so without this the folder vanishes from any
fresh clone - and it did: `checkrefs.py` reported `fragments/incoming` unresolved the first
time the fact base was cloned on 2026-10-07, against three documents that cite it as a path.
It had survived until then only because nothing had ever deleted it from the one working tree
that existed.
